        "x": -1995.3908682409563,
        "y": 46.81788310312322
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Search and forked processing",
        "body": "\nFor demonstration purposes we first send a single search term to two different types of data service - a literature and language service and an archaeological service. This gives us two families of data type to process. ***NB. The results displayed here are indicative only to illustrate the potential flow of data***"
